fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analytics/GstAnalyticsModelInfo.html#GstAnalyticsModelInfo","fragment":"\n\tGstAnalyticsModelInfo\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.ModelInfo\n\nThe GstAnalyticsModelInfo is an object storing artifical neural network\nmodel metadata describing the input and output tensors. These information's\nare required by inference elements.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nThe GstAnalytics.ModelInfo is an object storing artifical neural network\nmodel metadata describing the input and output tensors. These information's\nare required by inference elements.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nThe GstAnalytics.ModelInfo is an object storing artifical neural network\nmodel metadata describing the input and output tensors. These information's\nare required by inference elements.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});